Package: peoplenotp
Title: Clinical Certainty and Individual Meaningful Change Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Benedikt", "Schäfer",
           email = "benediktclaus@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Evaluate clinical certainty and practical significance for
    individual change trajectories and group-level interventions.
    Facilitates Region of Practical Equivalence (ROPE) and Minimal
    Important Difference (MID) evaluations using Bayesian posterior
    distributions generated via 'tidybayes' or empirical longitudinal data.
    Provides functions to calculate univariate and joint clinical certainty
    classifications, compute sensitivity grids across parameter thresholds,
    and visualize clinical boundaries with custom 'ggplot2' geoms, palettes,
    and publication-ready themes.
